an','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">License Agreements</b></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">2023 Lilly License</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 26, 2023, ZB17 entered into a license agreement with Lilly (the &#8220;2023 Lilly License&#8221; and, together with the 2022 Lilly License (as defined below), the &#8220;Lilly Licenses&#8221;), for an exclusive license to develop, manufacture and commercialize tibulizumab. As consideration, we paid Lilly an upfront payment consisting of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_hmVq-xIUzkukZgmYhfuChw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_JEvUG5ai1EqetGPCRUn0lw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireProductiveAssets" scale="6" id="Narr_V7dze62NXkChK5gGki-y8w">5.8</ix:nonFraction> million during 2023 and issued Class A Ordinary Shares at an aggregate fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_BHtM8CjCpE2kDM-FFZf99Q" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_TH-vRpnkq0imHf-LrcgzSQ" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_IoP_UQUEGkiBBu4M8Uvvvw">7.8</ix:nonFraction> million during the year ended 2023. During 2024, ZB17 made an additional payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_hmVq-xIUzkukZgmYhfuChw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_QmcojsSoekSygf0RrE5z2A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionContingentConsiderationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_z7jIQPJndUy9IZpmXtVABg">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million to Lilly in connection with the receipt of certain know-how, data, information and materials that Lilly is required to provide under the license agreement.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The acquisition was accounted for as an asset acquisition as substantially all of the fair value of the assets acquired is concentrated in a group of similar identifiable IPR&amp;D assets. On the acquisition date, the molecule licensed had not yet received regulatory approval and the IPR&amp;D did not have an alternative use. Accordingly, the Company expensed the entire cost of the 2023 Lilly License in research and development in the consolidated statement of operations during the year ended December 31, 2023.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In consideration for the investment made by Stone Peach Properties, LLC (&#8220;Stone Peach&#8221;), the Company entered into a letter agreement with Stone Peach and ZB17, dated April 24, 2023, as amended by letter agreement dated November 21, 2023 (the &#8220;ZB17 Letter Agreement&#8221;), pursuant to which ZB17 granted Stone Peach the right, but not the obligation, to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_si4okczwH0OleEbV2WySsw" contextRef="Duration_4_26_2023_To_4_26_2023_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_zura_StonePeachPropertiesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zura_LicenseAgreementWithLillyMember_0puEtoqRgEScaFprKXo_aw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zura:IssuedCallRightToPurchasePercentageOfFullyDilutedEquity" scale="-2" id="Narr_GGhoA8FjIU6kqY6EVGqPmg">4.99</ix:nonFraction>% of the fully diluted equity of ZB17 for $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_hmVq-xIUzkukZgmYhfuChw" contextRef="Duration_4_26_2023_To_4_26_2023_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_zura_StonePeachPropertiesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zura_LicenseAgreementWithLillyMember_0puEtoqRgEScaFprKXo_aw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zura:ValueOfIssuedCallRight" scale="6" id="Narr_0EkmHocrMEmdnmLxGaKqDA">1.0</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Stone Peach Call Right&#8221;). The Stone Peach Call Right was not exercisable until after the last patient is dosed in any single next clinical trial with tibulizumab and would expire <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_26_2023_To_4_26_2023_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_zura_StonePeachPropertiesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zura_LicenseAgreementWithLillyMember_0puEtoqRgEScaFprKXo_aw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="zura:ExpiryTermFromDateOfRegulatoryApprovalMilestone" id="Narr_PItpUEQdYE-sssO1Y0iX1w">one year</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of first indication approval for tibulizumab by the United States Food and Drug Administration (&#8220;FDA&#8221;) or the European Medicines Agency (&#8220;EMA&#8221;). We recognized the Stone Peach Call Right at a grant-date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_hmVq-xIUzkukZgmYhfuChw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_zura_StonePeachPropertiesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zura_LicenseAgreementWithLillyMember_bwON6flFpk6W2pvg5v09hg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zura:FairValueOfCallRightAtGrantDate" scale="6" id="Narr_AzlETjpY2UmQ0xMHE2pwqg">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million as a component of research and development in the consolidated statement of operations during the year ended December 31, 2023. The Stone Peach Call Right represented a noncontrolling interest in our consolidated subsidiary, ZB17. On December 29, 2025, the Company terminated the ZB17 Letter Agreement, and the noncontrolling interest was extinguished as of December 31, 2025. See &#8220;&#8212;Stone Peach Settlement and Release Agreement&#8221; below. As of December 31, 2024, the noncontrolling interest balance was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_hmVq-xIUzkukZgmYhfuChw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_zura_StonePeachPropertiesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zura_LicenseAgreementWithLillyMember_0CEHwglXW0SnREWyFcdSSA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterest" scale="6" id="Narr_SQ7VQiCTuk-G7rBJvErhaA">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million in the consolidated balance sheet.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Additionally, beginning on May 1, 2023, Stone Peach received an annual payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_hmVq-xIUzkukZgmYhfuChw" contextRef="Duration_4_26_2023_To_4_26_2023_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_zura_StonePeachPropertiesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zura_LicenseAgreementWithLillyMember_0puEtoqRgEScaFprKXo_aw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireIntangibleAssets" scale="6" id="Narr_frFXQNSVsEu05lby_wOWdg">0.6</ix:nonFraction> million initially, and increasing by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_si4okczwH0OleEbV2WySsw" contextRef="Duration_4_26_2023_To_4_26_2023_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_zura_Zb17LlcMember_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_zura_StonePeachPropertiesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zura_LicenseAgreementWithLillyMember_0puEtoqRgEScaFprKXo_aw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zura:PercentageOfAnnualIncreaseInPayment" scale="-2" id="Narr_nmzAQa7ei0Oed5w-4Zge9w">10</ix:nonFraction>% annually, so long as the Company maintains its license for tibulizumab, to be paid on May 1st<sup style="font-size:7.5pt;line-height:100%;top:0pt;vertical-align:top;"> </sup>of each year. The Company records expense for these annual payments when they become due.