ts.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">On August 12, 2024, the Company completed the Exchange Offer and Consent Solicitation and issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_B9wkd1v_sUeSSpxVjB0d7A" contextRef="Duration_8_12_2024_To_8_12_2024_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_PublicWarrantsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_g1PQNM4BxkSuGs60sUeB9w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zura:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesExchangeOfWarrants" scale="0" id="Narr_skoGPQxFAE6ZVorOQGtZmg">2,011,017</ix:nonFraction> Class A Ordinary Shares in exchange for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_B9wkd1v_sUeSSpxVjB0d7A" contextRef="As_Of_8_12_2024_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_IpoWarrantsMember_UAGoLb9mlkq_XD8dqEuC5g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_WZUSte7EiEOKwACNM4Y4cA">6,703,428</ix:nonFraction> Public Warrants and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_B9wkd1v_sUeSSpxVjB0d7A" contextRef="Duration_8_12_2024_To_8_12_2024_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_PrivatePlacementWarrantsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_SPq13CV-BE2_LxSgOB8XTQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zura:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesExchangeOfWarrants" scale="0" id="Narr_moRWbkYypUyFiU27LgV89g">1,224,167</ix:nonFraction> Class A Ordinary Shares in exchange for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_B9wkd1v_sUeSSpxVjB0d7A" contextRef="As_Of_8_12_2024_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_PrivatePlacementWarrantsMember_SkImy6-lukqZV4xcYxKohw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_hVgMiB40J0K5feWlJES4fg">4,080,580</ix:nonFraction> Private Placement Warrants. In connection with its completion of the Exchange Offer, the Company entered into an amendment, dated August 12, 2024 (the &#8220;Warrant Amendment&#8221;), to the Warrant Agreement to provide the Company with the right to mandatorily exchange the Company&#8217;s remaining outstanding IPO warrants for Class A ordinary shares at an exchange ratio of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_B9wkd1v_sUeSSpxVjB0d7A" contextRef="As_Of_8_12_2024_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_IpoWarrantsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_Aipc0Q_ZikCDGGIvVXYepQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" scale="0" id="Narr_cFAdIXSKXEivpa7P155XDA">0.27</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares for each IPO warrant. On August 27, 2024, in accordance with the Warrant Amendment, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_B9wkd1v_sUeSSpxVjB0d7A" contextRef="Duration_8_27_2024_To_8_27_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_MXz8zGbiWkOetM0Jv7e7hw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zura:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesExchangeOfWarrants" scale="0" id="Narr_Z7Kzyb_DtEOpMkF49FIsWA">547,006</ix:nonFraction> Class A Ordinary Shares in exchange for the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_B9wkd1v_sUeSSpxVjB0d7A" contextRef="As_Of_8_27_2024_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_PublicWarrantsMember_r2oB0eRMREO45PuTn2TR0Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_LnF4fhsfrEGtWMDGbWem4Q">196,568</ix:nonFraction> outstanding Public Warrants and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_B9wkd1v_sUeSSpxVjB0d7A" contextRef="As_Of_8_27_2024_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_PrivatePlacementWarrantsMember_lH219fyhTEO3wAD4xwivEA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_Na2vp9CAX0Cti4wJsC_N0