hares at a price to the public of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_BHtM8CjCpE2kDM-FFZf99Q" contextRef="As_Of_2_24_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_PreFundedWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_vXfsZA8_H0yPd_GKkZgrVw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_5iXhCqPlU02EukF-lqHx0A">6.249</ix:nonFraction> per Pre-Funded Warrant, which represents the per share public offering price for the Shares less the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_BHtM8CjCpE2kDM-FFZf99Q" contextRef="As_Of_2_24_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_zura_PreFundedWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_vXfsZA8_H0yPd_GKkZgrVw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_35KI9JCZeE2MGRV-Y4Fcfg">0.001</ix:nonFraction> exercise price of each Pre-Funded Warrant (the &#8220;Offering&#8221;). The net proceeds from the Offering were approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_hmVq-xIUzkukZgmYhfuChw" contextRef="Duration_2_25_2026_To_2_25_2026_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_YIwW17E6JUGLyjJpMR9rHA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" scale="6" id="Narr_KZhj_-ArQkSM1MVeNyEnkA">135.1</ix:nonFraction> million after deducting underwriting discounts and commissions and estimated offering expenses. The Offering closed on February 26, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style=